e.</li> <li><strong>Activity data</strong> — such as lists, tier lists, votes, comments, and preferences\n        stored to operate community features.</li> <li><strong>Technical data</strong> — such as IP address, browser type, device information, and\n        pages visited, collected in server logs and analytics to secure and improve the service.</li> <li><strong>Cookies and local storage</strong> — used for sign-in sessions, settings, and basic\n        site functionality. You can limit cookies in your browser; some features may not work without\n        them.</li></ul> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">How we use information</h2> <p>We use collected information to:</p> <ul><li>Provide, maintain, and personalize the site and your account</li> <li>Operate community features (playlists, tier lists, comments, and similar tools)</li> <li>Respond to support, abuse, and legal requests</li> <li>Monitor performance, fix errors, and protect against fraud or misuse</li> <li>Comply with applicable law</li></ul> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Sharing</h2> <p> </p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Retention &amp; security</h2> <p>We keep information for as long as your account is active or as needed for the purposes above,\n      then delete or anonymize it where reasonable. We use technical and organizational measures to\n      protect data, but no system is completely secure.</p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Your choices</h2> <p>You may update profile details in account settings where available. You may request access,\n      correction, or deletion of personal data by contacting us; we may need to verify your identity\n      and may retain certain records where the law requires.</p> <p>Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights (for example under GDPR or CCPA).\n      To exercise them, contact us using the details below.</p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Children</h2> <p> </p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Changes</h2> <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The revised version will be posted on this page\n      with an updated effective date. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the\n      updated policy.</p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Contact</h2> <p>Questions about this policy? <!> <!> form.</p></article></div>`);function Sa(r,a){j(a,!1),te(()=>{W.mutations.setBreadCrumbs([V(\"Home\",{name:\"home\"}),{name:\"Privacy Policy\"}])}),ye();var i=It();re(\"xa1hue\",g=>{var e=Tt();L(()=>q(e,\"content\",`How ${P} collects, uses, and protects your information.`)),oe(()=>{ie.title=`Privacy Policy — ${P}`}),s(g,e)});var c=l(i),f=u(l(c),2),d=l(f);o(f);var h=u(f,14),b=l(h);o(h);var S=u(h,14),x=l(S);o(S);var v=u(S,8),C=u(l(v));{var k=g=>{var e=z(\"Use our\");s(g,e)};M(C,g=>{g(k,-1)})}var m=u(C,2);Q(m,{route:{name:\"contact\"},children:(g,e)=>{B();var p=z(\"Contact\");s(g,p)},$$slots:{default:!0}}),B(),o(v),o(c),o(i),L(()=>{E(d,`This policy describes how ${P} handles information when you use our\n      website and signed-in features.`),E(b,`We do not sell your personal information. We may share data with service providers that help us\n      run hosting, analytics, authentication, or security — only as needed to operate ${P}, and\n      under obligations to protect it. We may also disclose information if required by law or to\n      protect users and the service.`),E(x,`${P} is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal\n      information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us data, please contact\n      us so we can remove it.`)}),s(r,i),F()}var Rt=$('<meta name=\"description\"/>'),Ut=$(`<div class=\"container abouts-page abouts-page--legal\"><article class=\"abouts-card\"><h1 class=\"abouts-page__title\">Terms of Service</h1> <p class=\"abouts-page__lead\"> </p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">The service</h2> <p> </p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Accounts</h2> <p>You must provide accurate registration information and keep your credentials confidential. You\n      are responsible for activity under your account. We may suspend or terminate accounts that\n      violate these terms or harm the community.</p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Acceptable use</h2> <p>You agree not to:</p> <ul><li>Use the site for unlawful purposes or to harass, abuse, or impersonate others</li> <li>Post spam, malware, or content that infringes intellectual property or privacy rights</li> <li>Attempt to probe, scrape, or disrupt our systems without permission</li> <li>Circumvent access controls or use automated means that overload the service</li></ul> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Your content</h2> <p> </p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Third-party material</h2> <p> <!> page.</p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Disclaimers</h2> <p>The site and all content are provided “as is” without warranties of any kind. We do not guarantee\n      accuracy, completeness, or availability of listings or community data. Use the site at your own\n      risk.</p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Limitation of liability</h2> <p> </p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Privacy</h2> <p>Our <!> explains how we handle personal\n      information and is incorporated into these terms.</p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Changes</h2> <p>We may revise these terms at any time by posting an updated version on this page. Continued use\n      after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p> <h2 class=\"abouts-page__subtitle\">Contact</h2> <p>Questions about these terms? <!> <!> form.</p></article></div>`);function xa(r,a){j(a,!1),te(()=>{W.mutations.setBreadCrumbs([V(\"Home\",{name:\"home\"}),{name:\"Terms of Service\"}])}),ye();var i=Ut();re(\"349pq7\",n=>{var _=Rt();L(()=>q(_,\"content\",`Terms for using ${P} — discovery, lists, and community features.`)),oe(()=>{ie.title=`Terms of Service — ${P}`}),s(n,_)});var c=l(i),f=u(l(c),2),d=l(f);o(f);var h=u(f,4),b=l(h);o(h);var 