n be split by catalog type.</p></section> <section class=\"user-picker-about__block\"><h3 class=\"user-picker-about__title\">Reputation and followers</h3> <p>Reputation is community reputation from likes and boosts others give your posts (capped per day) —\n        not a create-count. Contacting staff does not change it. Followers is how many people follow you.\n        Creating lists, clubs, or threads is not on this board.</p></section> <section class=\"user-picker-about__block\"><h3 class=\"user-picker-about__title\">Hide Me</h3> <p>People who turned on Hide Me in their profile are not listed here.</p></section> <section class=\"user-picker-about__block user-picker-about__block--warn\"><h3 class=\"user-picker-about__title\">Do not farm this board</h3> <p>Do not try to climb it by spamming views, empty reviews, fake likes, follow bots, or\n        mass-created content. That can get the account banned.</p></section> <section class=\"user-picker-about__block\"><h3 class=\"user-picker-about__title\">Ranks can change</h3> <p>What this board ranks can change from time to time. Lists, maps, and other community work\n        are not ranked here yet — keep making quality content so those can join later.</p></section></div>`),Cg=c('<div class=\"container page-users yt-content__inner text-card\"><header class=\"page-users__head\"><div class=\"page-users__title-row\"><h1 class=\"page-users__title\">Top Users</h1> <button type=\"button\" class=\"page-users__about\" aria-label=\"About these ranks\" title=\"About these ranks\">?</button></div> <p class=\"page-users__lead\">Top 100 by views, ratings, reputation, followers, and more</p></header> <!></div> <!>',1);function xg(l,t){gt(t,!0);const _=()=>xt(v,\"$breadCrumbsStore\",f),[f,C]=Kt(),v=na.getters.breadCrumbs;let S=se(!1),R=se(!1);const u=d(()=>`${on} — Top Users`),g=d(()=>ln(\"Browse who has the most views, ratings, reviews, likes, boosts, comments, reputation, and followers.\"));function o(){na.mutations.setBreadCrumbs([{