pamming views, empty reviews, fake likes, follow bots, or\n        mass-created content. That can get the account banned.</p></section> <section class=\"user-picker-about__block\"><h3 class=\"user-picker-about__title\">Ranks can change</h3> <p>What this board ranks can change from time to time. Lists, maps, and other community work\n        are not ranked here yet — keep making quality content so those can join later.</p></section></div>`),Cg=c('<div class=\"container page-users yt-content__inner text-card\"><header class=\"page-users__head\"><div class=\"page-users__title-row\"><h1 class=\"page-users__title\">Top Users</h1> <button type=\"button\" class=\"page-users__about\" aria-label=\"About these ranks\" title=\"About these ranks\">?</button></div> <p class=\"page-users__lead\">Top 100 by views, ratings, reputation, followers, and more</p></header> <!></div> <!>',1);function xg(l,t){gt(t,!0);const _=()=>xt(v,\"$breadCrumbsStore\",f),[f,C]=Kt(),v=na.getters.breadCrumbs;let S=se(!1),R=se(!1);const u=d(()=>`${on} — Top Users`),g=d(()=>ln(\"Browse who has the most views, ratings, reviews, likes, boosts, comments, reputation, and followers.\"));function o(){na.mutations.setBreadCrumbs([{name:\"Top Users\",url:{name:\"users\"}}])}Oc(o),Ut(()=>{o()}),Ut(()=>{Dc(_())&&o()});var I=Cg();Ei(\"rw1q0\",te=>{var H=wg(),Z=Te(H),q=n(Z,2),G=n(q,2),z=n(G,2);x(()=>{xe(Z,\"content\",e(g)),xe(q,\"content\",e(u)),xe(G,\"content\",e(g)),xe(z,\"content\",Ec)}),Jr(()=>{$r.title=e(u)??\"\"}),i(te,H)});var N=Te(I),p=s(N),W=s(p),P=n(s(W),2);r(W),_a(2),r(p);var $=n(p,2);qc($,{onready:()=>{a(S,!0)},besideList:H=>{yg(H,{room:\"ranking_users\",get pageReady(){return e(S)},variant:\"aside\"})},$$slots:{besideList:!0}}),r(N);var oe=n(N,2);nr(oe,{get open(){return e(R)},title:\"About these ranks\",onclose:()=>a(R,!1),footer:H=>{var Z=Sg();$e(\"click\",Z,()=>a(R,!1)),i(H,Z)},children:(H,Z)=>{var q=kg();i(H,q)},$$slots:{footer:!0,default:!0}}),$e(\"click\",P,()=>a(R,!0)),i(l,I),bt(),C()}Gt([\"click